[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29AHere are \u001b[1m6 practical options\u001b[m for building on the A2UI v1.0 + Antigravity integration in \u001b[94magy_genui_demo\u001b[m, ranging\r\n  from interactive agent round-trips to custom domain catalogs:\u001b[K\r\n  \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[1m### Option 1: Live Two-Way Action Loop (\u001b[94mButton\u001b[39m \u2192 Agent Turn + \u001b[94ma2uiRendererDataModel\u001b[39m Sync)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  Currently, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk6aa4e618b09a80ad;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L52\u0007ChatViewModel.forwardSurfaceActionsToAgent\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 defaults to \u001b[94mfalse\u001b[m (and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk5a04ae77311ea97f;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L610-L648\u0007ChatViewModel.sendSurfaceAction\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 is\r\n  invoked explicitly).\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u2022 \u001b[1mWhat we can build\u001b[m:\r\n      \u2022 Enable automatic round-tripping when a user clicks an \u001b[94mA2uiSurface\u001b[m \u001b[94mButton\u001b[m: dispatch the \u001b[94mActionMessage\u001b[m +\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94ma2uiRendererDataModel\u001b[m to the thread's Antig"]
[0.0, "o", "ravity \u001b[94mAgent\u001b[m, show a compact user \"Action Pill\" in the chat feed (e.\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K      g., \u001b[94m\u26a1 Action: book_flight (destination: Kyoto)\u001b[m), and let the agent either mutate the existing surface in-place\u001b[?7h\u001b[118G\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K      via \u001b[94mupdateDataModel\u001b[m/\u001b[94mupdateComponents\u001b[m or stream a follow-up surface.\u001b[?7h\u001b[74G\n\u001b[67D\u2022 Wire \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk1c2f7c55579c963e;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L365-L416\u0007ChatRepository.buildAgentConfig\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 so every regular text prompt also attaches \u001b[94mrenderer.\u001b[m\n\u001b[91D\u001b[94mgetRendererDataModel(version: A2uiProtocolVersion.v1_0)\u001b[m when active surfaces have \u001b[94msendDataModel: true\u001b[m, allowing\r\n\u001b[6Cthe user to fill out an A2UI form and type \u001b[3m\"Looks good, submit that\"\u001b[m in the Markdown composer.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\r\n  \u001b[1m### Option 2: Custom Workspace & Developer Catalog (\u001b[94mCatalogImplementation\u001b[39m Extensions)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  Right now \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk40ecc0377be618e3;file:///Users/brett/tmp/a"]
[0.0, "o", "gy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L103\u0007ChatRepository.defaultA2uiCatalog\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 uses the stock \u001b[94mbasicCatalog()\u001b[m. Because \u001b[94ma2ui_flutter\u001b[m's\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk8f508cc6ebcadfdd;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_flutter-0.1.0/lib/src/component_implementation.dart#L50\u0007ComponentImplementation\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 lets you pair any JSON Schema with a Flutter widget builder, we can extend the catalog with\r\n  developer-focused components tailored to an Antigravity coding assistant:\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u2022 \u001b[94mCodeDiffCard\u001b[m: Renders a side-by-side or unified diff preview with \u001b[1mApply Patch\u001b[m / \u001b[1mDiscard\u001b[m action buttons that\r\n  trigger an \u001b[94mActionMessage\u001b[m back\u001b[K\n\u001b[26D\u001b[94ma\u001b[90md\u001b[m\n\n\n\u001b[5D\u001b[?2026l"]
