[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29A\u2022 \u001b[1mWhat we can build\u001b[m:\r\n      \u2022 Add a toggleable right-hand \u001b[1mA2UI Inspector / Canvas pane\u001b[m in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk7c6023e49cabd509;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/chat_screen.dart#L70-L136\u0007ChatScreen\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jke9ec3288d2e5d685;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/top_toolbar.dart\u0007TopToolbar\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n\tPin any active surface from \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk348be2438c2d9ead;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_core-0.5.0/lib/src/core/surface_group_model.dart#L107\u0007renderer.model.allSurfaces\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 into the side canvas, with a live \u001b[1mData Model JSON\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[1minspector\u001b[m (\u001b[94msurface.dataModel\u001b[m) and \u001b[1mComponent Tree viewer\u001b[m so you can watch data bindings (\u001b[94m@path\u001b[m) and component\r\n\u001b[6Cupdates mutate in real time as you chat.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\r\n  \u001b[1m### Option 4: Self-Healing Validation Loop (Automatic LLM Repair on \u001b[94mAnswerErrorPart\u001b[39m)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  Currently, if the"]
