[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A      \u2022 Add a toggleable right-hand \u001b[1mA2UI Inspector / Canvas pane\u001b[m in \u001b]8;id=jk2c587fdc2949b9ca;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/chat_screen.dart#L70-L136\u001b\\\u001b[4;34;4mC\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mh\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mS\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mc\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mn\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\ and \u001b]8;id=jk86434a0d5949bd0c;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/top_toolbar.dart\u001b\\\u001b[4;34;4mT\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mp\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mT\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ml\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mb\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\u001b[6C\u2022 Pin any active surface from \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkf975f96b26960fa6;file:///Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/a2ui_core-0.5.0/lib/src/core/surface_group_model.dart#L107\u0007renderer.model.allSurfaces\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 into the side canvas, with a live \u001b[1mData Model JSON\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[1minspector\u001b[m (\u001b[94msurface.dataModel\u001b[m) and \u001b[1mComponent Tree viewer\u001b[m so you can watch data bindings (\u001b[94m@path\u001b[m) and co"]
[0.0, "o", "mponent\r\n\u001b[6Cupdates mutate in real time as you chat.\r\n\n  \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\r\n  \u001b[1m### Option 4: Self-Healing Validation Loop (Automatic LLM Repair on \u001b[94mAnswerErrorPart\u001b[39m)\u001b[m\r\n\n  Currently, if the LLM emits a malformed \u001b[94m<a2ui-json>\u001b[m block or violates a component schema, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk8211774bc7b97e9b;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L662-L665\u0007StreamedAnswer\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 rolls back\r\n  that block and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk342ca2973f5f5377;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/message_bubble.dart#L186-L195\u0007MessageBubble\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 displays \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk7a010405b2e6e61;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/message_bubble.dart#L352-L386\u0007_InlineA2uiErrorBanner\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n\n  \u2022 \u001b[1mWhat we can build\u001b[m:\n\u001b[16D\u2022 Add a \u001b[1mFix Surface\u001b[m button on \u001b[94m_InlineA2uiErrorBanner\u001b[m (or an automatic 1-retry self-repair option in\n\u001b[99D\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk38f9fdd5d75fd8bf;file:///Users/brett"]
[0.0, "o", "/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart\u0007ChatViewModel\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007) that sends the rejected \u001b[94mA2uiError\u001b[m (\u001b[94mErrorMessage(version: '1.0', error: ...)\u001b[m) back to the\r\n\u001b[6Cthread's Antigravity session so the agent repairs the surface automatically.\r\n\n  \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\r\n  \u001b[1m### Option 5: Agent-Driven Clarification Forms (\"Ask Question\" Surface Pattern)\u001b[m\r\n\n  When the Antigravity agent needs requirements clarified before writing code or running tools in the project\r\n  workspace:\r\n\n  \u2022 \u001b[1mWhat we can build\u001b[m:\n\u001b[16D\u2022 Update \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9db54249e9fd06a2;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L113-L119\u0007ChatRepository.defaultSystemInstructions\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and add starter templates so the agent emits an interactive\r\n\u001b[6CA2UI v1.0 form (\u001b[94mChoicePicker\u001b[m with \u001b[94mchips\u001b[m/\u001b[94mcheckbox\u001b[m, \u001b[94mTextField\u001b[m, \u001b[94mCheckBox\u001b[m, \u001b[94mSlider\u001b[m, and a primary \u001b[94mSubmit\u001b[m \u001b[94mButton\u001b[m)\r\n\u001b[6Cinstead of plain-text questions.\n"]
