[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A\u001b[K\r\n  Currently, if the LLM emits a malformed \u001b[94m<a2ui-json>\u001b[m block or violates a component schema, \u001b]8;id=jk995d2953bb6205a8;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L662-L665\u001b\\\u001b[4;34;4mS\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mm\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4md\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mA\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mn\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ms\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mw\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\ rolls back\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  that block and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk49ae8f3b45d7f34a;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/message_bubble.dart#L186-L195\u0007MessageBubble\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 displays \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3b131aac523eef40;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/message_bubble.dart#L352-L386\u0007_InlineA2uiErrorBanner\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n\n  \u2022 \u001b[1mWhat we can build\u001b[m:\n\u001b[16D\u2022 Add a \u001b[1mFix Surface\u001b[m button on \u001b[94m_InlineA2uiErrorBanner\u001b[m (or an automatic 1-retry self-repair option in\n\u001b[99D\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkfe72d7811b5edc;file:///Users/"]
[0.0, "o", "brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart\u0007ChatViewModel\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007) that sends the rejected \u001b[94mA2uiError\u001b[m (\u001b[94mErrorMessage(version: '1.0', error: ...)\u001b[m) back to the\r\n\u001b[6Cthread's Antigravity session so the agent repairs the surface automatically.\r\n\n  \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\r\n  \u001b[1m### Option 5: Agent-Driven Clarification Forms (\"Ask Question\" Surface Pattern)\u001b[m\r\n\n  When the Antigravity agent needs requirements clarified before writing code or running tools in the project\r\n  workspace:\r\n\n  \u2022 \u001b[1mWhat we can build\u001b[m:\n\u001b[16D\u2022 Update \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk63d423840f237f6f;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L113-L119\u0007ChatRepository.defaultSystemInstructions\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and add starter templates so the agent emits an interactive\r\n\u001b[6CA2UI v1.0 form (\u001b[94mChoicePicker\u001b[m with \u001b[94mchips\u001b[m/\u001b[94mcheckbox\u001b[m, \u001b[94mTextField\u001b[m, \u001b[94mCheckBox\u001b[m, \u001b[94mSlider\u001b[m, and a primary \u001b[94mSubmit\u001b[m \u001b[94mButton\u001b[m)\r\n\u001b[6Cinstead of plain-text questi"]
[0.0, "o", "ons.\n\u001b[32D\u2022 When the user submits the form, the resolved JSON context is sent straight back to the agent to continue\r\n\u001b[6Cexecution.\r\n\n  \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\r\n  \u001b[1m### Option 6: A2UI Express Format Toggle (\u001b[94mDirectJsonFormatFactory\u001b[39m vs. \u001b[94mExpressFormatFactory\u001b[39m)\u001b[m\r\n\n  \u001b[94ma2ui_agent\u001b[m supports both \u001b[94m<a2ui-json>\u001b[m (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3a7132bf08071c79;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L107-L108\u0007DirectJsonFormatFactory\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007) and the compact token-saving A2UI Express DSL\r\n  (\u001b[94mExpressFormatFactory\u001b[m) over the exact same \u001b[94mStreamedAnswer\u001b[m and \u001b[94mMessageProcessor\u001b[m pipeline.\r\n\n  \u2022 **What we **\r\n\u28fb  \u001b[94mG\u001b[90menerating...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500"]
